(4327765, 622229, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice smoothing of the water and mist, but a little bland on subject matter IMO.  Nothing personal, I like what you''ve done overall, just nothing exciting to rest my eyes on.</td>', 'Nice smoothing of the water and mist, but a little bland on subject matter IMO.  Nothing personal, I like what you''ve done overall, just nothing exciting to rest my eyes on.', '2007-12-21 09:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
