(4327777, 623772, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little bizarre, yet interesting.  :-)  I like the captured motion.  The exposure ran just a little long and has blown some highlights (particularly the flowers).  The sun flare adds a little wonder, like "what the heck is it?", at first glance.  You''ll certainly be slowing some viewers down to check this out - hopefully!  Good luck.</td>', 'A little bizarre, yet interesting.  :-)  I like the captured motion.  The exposure ran just a little long and has blown some highlights (particularly the flowers).  The sun flare adds a little wonder, like "what the heck is it?", at first glance.  You''ll certainly be slowing some viewers down to check this out - hopefully!  Good luck.', '2007-12-21 09:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327782, 622609, 88010, '<td valign="top">Off and into oblivion. Nice capture and I really like the exposre keeping the sky dark and keeping some mystery to this scene. Good job.</td>', 'Off and into oblivion. Nice capture and I really like the exposre keeping the sky dark and keeping some mystery to this scene. Good job.', '2007-12-21 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327784, 623842, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice POV for this.  Bet it was cold!  Brrrr...  :-)  Nice idea and end result.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice POV for this.  Bet it was cold!  Brrrr...  :-)  Nice idea and end result.  Good luck.', '2007-12-21 09:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327785, 623753, 88010, '<td valign="top">Another very nice moving ocean shot.</td>', 'Another very nice moving ocean shot.', '2007-12-21 09:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327787, 623857, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, really shows the hustle and bustle og Holiday shopping.</td>', 'Very cool shot, really shows the hustle and bustle og Holiday shopping.', '2007-12-21 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327789, 623576, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like how you had a nice solid foundation for the camera.  The buildings and office windows are tack sharp, yet you have people in motion and the vehicle lights for impact.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like how you had a nice solid foundation for the camera.  The buildings and office windows are tack sharp, yet you have people in motion and the vehicle lights for impact.  Nicely done!', '2007-12-21 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327790, 622730, 30049, '<td valign="top">This could be a postcard.  :-)  Well seen and captured.</td>', 'This could be a postcard.  :-)  Well seen and captured.', '2007-12-21 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327792, 623576, 88010, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice lines in the bus light movement. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Wow, very nice lines in the bus light movement. Excellent shot.', '2007-12-21 09:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327797, 623847, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  If you could have gotten the primary exposure sharper (non blurry) this would score at least 1 to 2 points higher IMO.  Nonetheless a creative effort.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is interesting.  If you could have gotten the primary exposure sharper (non blurry) this would score at least 1 to 2 points higher IMO.  Nonetheless a creative effort.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-21 09:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327801, 623775, 88010, '<td valign="top">This shot has an extra appeal with the sun hiding behind that big rock. Nice composition.</td>', 'This shot has an extra appeal with the sun hiding behind that big rock. Nice composition.', '2007-12-21 09:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327806, 623066, 88010, '<td valign="top">Moving water and  night scene combined. Very nice .</td>', 'Moving water and  night scene combined. Very nice .', '2007-12-21 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327808, 623514, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice. That train looks as if it''s going 100 mph. Everything else is tack sharp and the exposure seems excellent.</td>', 'Very nice. That train looks as if it''s going 100 mph. Everything else is tack sharp and the exposure seems excellent.', '2007-12-21 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327817, 622191, 30049, '<td valign="top">One of the crisper traffic/city lights shots in the challenge.  Hooray!  :-) Good job of securing the camera for this long exposure shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'One of the crisper traffic/city lights shots in the challenge.  Hooray!  :-) Good job of securing the camera for this long exposure shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-21 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327818, 623676, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  It''s growing on me...aaarrrrggghhhh, it IS a nightmare!!!  :-P  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  It''s growing on me...aaarrrrggghhhh, it IS a nightmare!!!  :-P  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-21 09:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327821, 623704, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice POV for this.</td>', 'Nice POV for this.', '2007-12-21 09:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327880, 623541, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you took this shot from.  I''d like to see the exposure be a little longer to add more blur, but without some hefty ND''s is probably tricky to do.</td>', 'I like the angle that you took this shot from.  I''d like to see the exposure be a little longer to add more blur, but without some hefty ND''s is probably tricky to do.', '2007-12-21 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327884, 623608, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is creative.  :-)  That moon looks like the sun with this exposure length.  Well done!</td>', 'This is creative.  :-)  That moon looks like the sun with this exposure length.  Well done!', '2007-12-21 10:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327885, 623212, 87998, '<td valign="top">well done. nice perspective and composition as well.</td>', 'well done. nice perspective and composition as well.', '2007-12-21 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327886, 623029, 87998, '<td valign="top">fantastic image. very unique.</td>', 'fantastic image. very unique.', '2007-12-21 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327887, 623376, 87998, '<td valign="top">well done. it looks like you are on top of a mountain looking down at clouds at first glance. very cool idea for a long exposure.</td>', 'well done. it looks like you are on top of a mountain looking down at clouds at first glance. very cool idea for a long exposure.', '2007-12-21 10:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327888, 623558, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The minor right side vignette is a little distracting, but otherwise well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The minor right side vignette is a little distracting, but otherwise well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-21 10:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327891, 622085, 87998, '<td valign="top">well done. the colors are fantastic. nice vantage point.</td>', 'well done. the colors are fantastic. nice vantage point.', '2007-12-21 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327892, 623785, 30049, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  Looks like daylight!  I''d have knocked the blue down a smidge with a color temp adjustment, but otherwise this is a nice shot.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!</td>', 'Amazing.  Looks like daylight!  I''d have knocked the blue down a smidge with a color temp adjustment, but otherwise this is a nice shot.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!', '2007-12-21 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327895, 623666, 87998, '<td valign="top">cool idea!</td>', 'cool idea!', '2007-12-21 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327896, 622316, 87998, '<td valign="top">really nice image! great curves. great vantage point to take the shot from. well done.</td>', 'really nice image! great curves. great vantage point to take the shot from. well done.', '2007-12-21 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327897, 623775, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes.  Very nice!  Great color and nice smoothing of the water flow with this timed exposure.  See you on the front page at rollover!  :-)</td>', 'Ah, yes.  Very nice!  Great color and nice smoothing of the water flow with this timed exposure.  See you on the front page at rollover!  :-)', '2007-12-21 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327898, 623825, 87998, '<td valign="top">i like the lines of the stars and the silhouettes.</td>', 'i like the lines of the stars and the silhouettes.', '2007-12-21 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327899, 622746, 87998, '<td valign="top">i like the concept.</td>', 'i like the concept.', '2007-12-21 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327900, 623655, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever use of the parked vehicle for added drama and context.</td>', 'Clever use of the parked vehicle for added drama and context.', '2007-12-21 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 1);
