(4332388, 623717, 5364, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I didn''t find this very interesting and I also don''t get why or how it''s a long exposure.</td>', 'Sorry, I didn''t find this very interesting and I also don''t get why or how it''s a long exposure.', '2007-12-24 04:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332390, 622777, 5364, '<td valign="top">Although I can see it''s a long exposure, the subject is too indistinct to make it sufficiently interesting.</td>', 'Although I can see it''s a long exposure, the subject is too indistinct to make it sufficiently interesting.', '2007-12-24 04:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332391, 623557, 5364, '<td valign="top">I guess you''ve been painting with light, but it''s rather too subtle to stand out.</td>', 'I guess you''ve been painting with light, but it''s rather too subtle to stand out.', '2007-12-24 04:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332392, 623279, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you would have had a more interesting image if you had photographed the city lights that are in the background as that''s where my eyes are drawn to.</td>', 'I think you would have had a more interesting image if you had photographed the city lights that are in the background as that''s where my eyes are drawn to.', '2007-12-24 04:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332395, 623756, 5364, '<td valign="top">there''s not enough in this image to make it interesting - the large are of emptiness at the top doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'there''s not enough in this image to make it interesting - the large are of emptiness at the top doesn''t add anything.', '2007-12-24 04:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332396, 623790, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is a bit confused about what the subject is - Although the castle is the obvious subject, the bright lights distract from it so it''s all rather muddled.</td>', 'This is a bit confused about what the subject is - Although the castle is the obvious subject, the bright lights distract from it so it''s all rather muddled.', '2007-12-24 04:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332397, 623352, 5364, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but you could have done with a longer exposure - maybe if you had waited until evening so the sky wouldn''t have been too bright?</td>', 'A nice idea, but you could have done with a longer exposure - maybe if you had waited until evening so the sky wouldn''t have been too bright?', '2007-12-24 04:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332398, 623620, 80821, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, meybe change the boarder to gun-metal grey ...</td>', 'Nice shot, meybe change the boarder to gun-metal grey ...', '2007-12-24 04:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332401, 623441, 5364, '<td valign="top">Although it''s a perfectly good image, it doesn''t convey any feeling of long-exposure - maybe if you could have left the cigarette burning longer so you had a longer area of glowing ash?</td>', 'Although it''s a perfectly good image, it doesn''t convey any feeling of long-exposure - maybe if you could have left the cigarette burning longer so you had a longer area of glowing ash?', '2007-12-24 04:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332409, 623483, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m left wondering what the subject is here - is it the street-light or the light-trails - because having them at either end of the image leaves me looking for something interesting in the middle, and not finding anything.</td>', 'I''m left wondering what the subject is here - is it the street-light or the light-trails - because having them at either end of the image leaves me looking for something interesting in the middle, and not finding anything.', '2007-12-24 04:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332421, 623366, 5364, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I''m just not artistically literate enough, but I don''t get anything from this - I''m lost understanding what you are trying to convey.</td>', 'Perhaps I''m just not artistically literate enough, but I don''t get anything from this - I''m lost understanding what you are trying to convey.', '2007-12-24 04:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332422, 622939, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you might have been better putting this in context and including the fire surround.</td>', 'I think you might have been better putting this in context and including the fire surround.', '2007-12-24 04:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
