(4334708, 623785, 70036, '<td valign="top">I think this image could stand alone without the heavy border. Great exposure.  The brightness of the lighthouse and upper left corner in general detracts a bit from the beautiful foreground.   But great for Basic.</td>', 'I think this image could stand alone without the heavy border. Great exposure.  The brightness of the lighthouse and upper left corner in general detracts a bit from the beautiful foreground.   But great for Basic.', '2007-12-25 19:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
