(4335043, 623194, 70514, '<td valign="top">"Fear" and "Trepidation" are not the words I use to describe my feelings when I come upon the VERY RARE roundabout (I know of two in the KC Metro area). More like, "Whoa, what is THAT thing?  what to do what to do what to do???? Where''s the brake???"  But yes, it is a nice image that shows the benefits of continually moving traffic.  (You do realize though that the cars are in the wrong lanes, right?)</td>', '"Fear" and "Trepidation" are not the words I use to describe my feelings when I come upon the VERY RARE roundabout (I know of two in the KC Metro area). More like, "Whoa, what is THAT thing?  what to do what to do what to do???? Where''s the brake???"  But yes, it is a nice image that shows the benefits of continually moving traffic.  (You do realize though that the cars are in the wrong lanes, right?)', '2007-12-26 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
