(4335105, 623856, 85310, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DistantColours:</b></div><hr/><i> it''s not level. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The spirit level on my tripod begs to differ. ;-)<br/> <br/>Seriously though, it is difficult to see where "level" should be in this picture, as there are no convenient reference points. The bridge in the background is part of a banked curve on the Queensway. To confound things further, it is angled away from the viewer and on a slight downhill slope from right to left.</td>', 'Originally posted by DistantColours: it''s not level.   The spirit level on my tripod begs to differ. ;-) Seriously though, it is difficult to see where "level" should be in this picture, as there are no convenient reference points. The bridge in the background is part of a banked curve on the Queensway. To confound things further, it is angled away from the viewer and on a slight downhill slope from right to left.', '2007-12-26 01:13:56.000000', NULL, 0),
