(4335116, 622537, 63503, '<td valign="top">1/10 sec is definitely not a USUAL exposure, so, IMHO it is a long exposure shot. Under-rated, should have placed much better.</td>', '1/10 sec is definitely not a USUAL exposure, so, IMHO it is a long exposure shot. Under-rated, should have placed much better.', '2007-12-26 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
