(4335205, 623376, 60165, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by B74A:</b></div><hr/><i> Ah, this challenge has a lot of these sunrise/sunset ocean+cliff shots! The competition is hard, but this must be another top-10, if not ribbon maybe? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am sorry to be proven wrong here, I think you should have done a lot better - can''t believe my own picture did better than yours! Your picture <i>rocks</i>, especially these vivid colors ... <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work, and happy new year!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-26 02:52:51.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by B74A: Ah, this challenge has a lot of these sunrise/sunset ocean+cliff shots! The competition is hard, but this must be another top-10, if not ribbon maybe?   I am sorry to be proven wrong here, I think you should have done a lot better - can''t believe my own picture did better than yours! Your picture rocks, especially these vivid colors ...  Keep up the good work, and happy new year!', '2007-12-26 02:49:15.000000', '2007-12-26 02:52:51.000000', 0),
