(4336370, 623029, 42171, '<td valign="top">Can''t bbelieve you got so many sticklers for the rules objecting to the centre composition of the main object.<br/> <br/>To me, this is very well balanced, with the yellow light of the ski resort and the white light of the moon being focus points in their own right. The hut in the centre helps to balance these two out very well.<br/> <br/>An excellent capture - You should be proud!</td>', 'Can''t bbelieve you got so many sticklers for the rules objecting to the centre composition of the main object. To me, this is very well balanced, with the yellow light of the ski resort and the white light of the moon being focus points in their own right. The hut in the centre helps to balance these two out very well. An excellent capture - You should be proud!', '2007-12-26 14:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
