(4337945, 623685, 83441, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by B74A:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your score ... flat? I like it this way, though a night shot would probably do it well, too!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by B74A:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice! First impression: London, but does not look like that. Second impression: Kuala Lumpur - but where are the other buildings, as well as the path between the two towers? So ... I look forward to hear where this is from! 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So it <i>was</i> KL ... I see now the Petronas tower <i>escape route connection bridge</i> is just down in the trees. What is this place called in KL, as I want to go there some day ... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. <br/>The location is <i>Titiwangsa Lake Garden</i>. It''s the northern part of KL and about 15 minutes taxi ride from the Petronas Tower.</td>', 'Originally posted by B74A: Congrats on your score ... flat? I like it this way, though a night shot would probably do it well, too! Originally posted by B74A: Nice! First impression: London, but does not look like that. Second impression: Kuala Lumpur - but where are the other buildings, as well as the path between the two towers? So ... I look forward to hear where this is from! 7   So it was KL ... I see now the Petronas tower escape route connection bridge is just down in the trees. What is this place called in KL, as I want to go there some day ...   Thanks. The location is Titiwangsa Lake Garden. It''s the northern part of KL and about 15 minutes taxi ride from the Petronas Tower.', '2007-12-27 06:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
