(4338772, 623775, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations. Well crafted shot and an improvement over your others like it. Curious, did you use shadow/highlights? It looks like some tone mapping type work was done and S/H is about the only thing left you cna use in basic. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No, I didn''t use tone mapping nor S/H. Tone mapping can not make this photo better. Haven''t tried S/H yet. Will try it and see if it''s good.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-27 16:27:37.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Congratulations. Well crafted shot and an improvement over your others like it. Curious, did you use shadow/highlights? It looks like some tone mapping type work was done and S/H is about the only thing left you cna use in basic.  No, I didn''t use tone mapping nor S/H. Tone mapping can not make this photo better. Haven''t tried S/H yet. Will try it and see if it''s good.', '2007-12-27 13:45:47.000000', '2007-12-27 16:27:37.000000', 0),
