(4345386, 623352, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the high wind in this image. I think it was an excellent idea, and would have worked if the exposure had been longer than 1/6 second.</td>', 'I don''t see the high wind in this image. I think it was an excellent idea, and would have worked if the exposure had been longer than 1/6 second.', '2007-12-30 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4345467, 623772, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the textures and neutral colors in this image. The lens flares create an exciting sparkle while the background looks like an oil painting. I haven''t any idea what he was doing in 1/6 second to create that much blur, but it works for me. Normally I wouldn''t like the horizontal barrier the flowers create, but in this case, the white of the flowers balances the bucket, the lens flares, the blur, and the vertical lines of the wall. All together this image, which shouldn''t work does work as art. IMHO</td>', 'I love the textures and neutral colors in this image. The lens flares create an exciting sparkle while the background looks like an oil painting. I haven''t any idea what he was doing in 1/6 second to create that much blur, but it works for me. Normally I wouldn''t like the horizontal barrier the flowers create, but in this case, the white of the flowers balances the bucket, the lens flares, the blur, and the vertical lines of the wall. All together this image, which shouldn''t work does work as art. IMHO', '2007-12-30 17:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
